{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place pegs and drop balls, thats it. It might sound simple but ploink has a lot of depth in the various items you can obtain during your runs. The key to winning is coming up with a  combination of items that will get you over the score requirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.poster.avif?t=1767450322\" width=780 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.webm?t=1767450322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.mp4?t=1767450322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploink isn't designed around forced interactions between specific items, it's designed for you to find cool synergies on your own, some even I didn't expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/ba1a32bd5d75da8ea4f03f15190a29e4.avif?t=1767450322\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pegs are the bread and butter of your builds, offering a wide variety of game mechanics to play with, such as...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give balls score and multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, block, redirect and teleport balls around the board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate money, create new pegs and spawn more balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explode and shoot balls with various military grade explosives and turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your board with new dimensions or just create a new universe entirely</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/fc71d52fcc290ba7536aa1edad51b674.avif?t=1767450322\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls are the friendly faces you must unfortunately sacrifice to THE VOID. They're less crazy than pegs but still offer interesting mechanics that might interact with specific pegs...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn more balls when dropped</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain score multiplier, increasing the score gained from pegs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different sizes and changes in physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport or respawn under certain conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealing or destroying shop items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One time effects such as gaining a lot of balls or powering up your balls</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929350?t=1767450322","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/9ad64ca278d38797f7ca524dc4eaa9df86335a14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767450322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/7f7d7ac203ae7cb3f3f0ea9734aa8c65f002355c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767450322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/7f7d7ac203ae7cb3f3f0ea9734aa8c65f002355c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767450322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3932590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place pegs and drop balls, thats it. It might sound simple but ploink has a lot of depth in the various items you can obtain during your runs. The key to winning is coming up with a  combination of items that will get you over the score requirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.poster.avif?t=1767450322\" width=780 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.webm?t=1767450322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/f0fc81c69cf1e24ba4bb078e20aa94cb.mp4?t=1767450322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploink isn't designed around forced interactions between specific items, it's designed for you to find cool synergies on your own, some even I didn't expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/ba1a32bd5d75da8ea4f03f15190a29e4.avif?t=1767450322\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pegs are the bread and butter of your builds, offering a wide variety of game mechanics to play with, such as...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give balls score and multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, block, redirect and teleport balls around the board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate money, create new pegs and spawn more balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explode and shoot balls with various military grade explosives and turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your board with new dimensions or just create a new universe entirely</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 